835d7bda57d58ad3023b5a271ef3b40f64451c"} {"question" "q-333646" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The general solution of the system is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}]={c}_{1}{e}^{-4t}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+{c}_{2}{e}^{-t}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\n- The line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny=\\frac{1}{2}x.\n$$\n\nThe straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{1}{e}^{-4t}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on that line and approach the origin as $t\\to \\infty .$ So, $y=\\frac{1}{2}x$ is $\\text{a stable}$ line.\n\n- The line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny=-x.\n$$\n\nThe straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{2}{e}^{-t}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on that line and approach the origin as $t\\to \\infty .$ So, $y=-x$ is $\\text{a stable}$ line.\n\nTherefore, the equilibrium point (origin) is $\\text{a stable node (sink)}.$ \n\n**Note:** The phase portrait of the system looks as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14069584/assets/6337a670b6fa73c4c21759b600269cb83d808a1c13026c90e2d02519fa31cd67.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14069584/state.json" "file_sha256" "b604e3cf3d1bb5fd9774f1ad83835d7bda57d58ad3023b5a271ef3b40f64451c"} {"question" "q-333646" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14069584/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b20be943601aa019f404b7f365efd0336dcd5697c2bf0e37d0e29a3fef87be38"} {"question" "q-333646" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/select "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14069584/state.json" "file_sha256" "b604e3cf3d1bb5fd9774f1ad83835d7bda57d58ad3023b5a271ef3b40f64451c"} {"question" "q-333646" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "a stable"] ["text" "an unstable"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14069584/state.json" "file_sha256" "b604e3cf3d1bb5fd9774f1ad83835d7bda57d58ad3023b5a271ef3b40f64451c"} {"question" "q-333646" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "a stable"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14069584/state.json" "file_sha256" "b604e3cf3d1bb5fd9774f1ad83835d7bda57d58ad3023b5a271ef3b40f64451c"} {"question" "q-333646" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/select "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14069584/state.json" "file_sha256" "b604e3cf3d1bb5fd9774f1ad83835d7bda57d58ad3023b5a271ef3b40f64451c"} {"question" "q-333646" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "x=0"] ["math" "y=-x"] ["math" "y=2x"] ["math" "y=x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14069584/state.json" "file_sha256" "b604e3cf3d1bb5fd9774f1ad83835d7bda57d58ad3023b5a271ef3b40f64451c"} {"question" "q-333646" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "y=-x"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacade